doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153360","source_hash":"7208b359ed43383ba657589b856b513b99afb1f7866896234efe93f831c1a0ab","text":"1) 解剖室"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00013","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153361","source_hash":"82e6fc31555d2793f924cab53f81699324420b76288f97dc618f38246b120d64","text":"a) 提供已去除灰尘、细菌等的洁净空气，以防止感染"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00014","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153362","source_hash":"b1fc215126bfc91c23b25117065e5c8caf591a33ffc3bdd3ca528486bf96fdbe","text":"配备空气净化设施"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00015","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153363","source_hash":"92e1ec3efc29037fbcb5ab31bd1f9457663b5bb5e96f7c325a8b79312a477882","text":"b) 内墙应防止潮气渗入，并配备必要的排水设施。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00016","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153364","source_hash":"c463ac97d7cd2c9e91103729ab7d6bf2dbbcd10a4c5493fc7fc5d1f958fd3240","text":"c) 配备供暖、制冷和照明设施"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00017","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153365","source_hash":"a04e4b89c2c29ba73e8594f7390ede06d3b6adbec730d111f39beaebc780797a","text":"d) 配备解剖服、解剖器械、消毒设备和无菌清洗设施"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00018","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153366","source_hash":"86117c1d9bc977a47ed965be69c6635b151132b640821ad20e502fe74a55c4d5","text":"e) 配备标本成像设备，用于拍摄尸检和解剖结果。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00019","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153367","source_hash":"3daae0f99b40410ea8e171e6e6041f150d0a50406ce4a67921e7695bf3a39994","text":"2) 实验室：用于病理学检测和质量控制检测等，以满足研究需求"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00020","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153368","source_hash":"948a491317e3fd265d4cb7065459a1a4d398f4c2b2edd1a62fd75ac48701b3bc","text":"装备设备"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00021","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153369","source_hash":"1b1cbe8094fc63e0f9ab889b21ee827ff10643c8b959b6b61a4421749570c411","text":"3) 太平间（冥想室）：配备冷藏和消毒设施，以防止尸体腐烂"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00022","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153370","source_hash":"4fb613ba59b010a55778788d4200d8e888f5fa511dd16b15193036e15eeb72f2","text":"4) 尸体部件储存室：卫生安全地储存用于研究的尸体部件"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00023","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153371","source_hash":"bdf3825991551ff80d6b4d57d2c4e58601e8bb3b8b36f15bddde3d7838cb8959","text":"必须有能够储存和管理[物品]的设施，并且[必须有]储存期间质量控制所需的冷藏[物品]。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00024","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153372","source_hash":"af1348cc7416fe3b6fd387d91246649dfcaf4f9c7a3b80795c64b4f67379a3d4","text":"配备制冷设备和监控设备，能够全天 24 小时检查温度变化。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00025","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153373","source_hash":"a32beec526f955ea841bcb2a2da27a7474cb5dfd012b4a8dea77e9e5c31d9599","text":"档案：有关尸体及尸体部位的收集、储存和提供的记录"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00026","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153374","source_hash":"3fe44f77d43adc5306d77a65d123a2da5f20315ce60980c1124b8d2101b7ad00","text":"配备诸如带锁书架之类的设施，用于管理和控制"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00027","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153375","source_hash":"8731ec2c49b487e1ab4757dbd6953b8bfd807153230c35ba8e7c8f0458add943","text":"6) 办公室和咨询室：与第 1) 至 5) 项中的设施分开隔断。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00028","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153376","source_hash":"4bdf64bad00853e6cc1812a390681a239205a19cf632444f430b7c91344c1b8d","text":"2. 人力标准"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00029","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153377","source_hash":"5f698feb74ff0930e0da1368391fd80631e993f712cafd22fd6090ffb055c90e","text":"以下各项至少需要雇用一人。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00030","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153378","source_hash":"60374d320cf8d7539f2bc287ec5adc8b893ad18643bb23c4405d38296bff07ff","text":"a. 负责人：指与相关机构有关联的人员，根据本法第2条第1款或第2款的规定，负责处理机构相关事宜。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00031","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153379","source_hash":"350ec540f02d1f80012e5690b376175e16e4e828103ac96f3c897d5f6305f82f","text":"."},{"id":"A29586-zh-00032","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153380","source_hash":"6e7c07650b7792df9f8829fa9f46794a9ed162be0e598c03c2e123092794d2ad","text":"B. 负责诊断的人员：仅限病理学家。但是，对于特定领域的研究，例如脑部疾病，"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00033","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153381","source_hash":"9c24c384688ae490e0243001bd91056e5bd4c19bd24e630e2962361805d0f73d","text":"如果需要提供尸体，负责人应接受病理诊断等方面的适当培训。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00034","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153382","source_hash":"339a46c018a7d33f1b892847ce4cc9f344c5414d5940faf3c132846fbe1d77d6","text":"病理学领域之外，具有尸检诊断经验的专家被称为诊断医师。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00035","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153383","source_hash":"631e114d9735bfd095b32b2a9b6145e7539fd7de5d2bbe715aa98cd9f713b700","text":"."},{"id":"A29586-zh-00036","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153384","source_hash":"6a10d8083aa63ffc9c5ee4bf4f6a32c500366928e094d64ddc6fb0bd5c0b32c4","text":"负责收集、处理和管理尸体及尸体部位的人员：持有相关领域的学位。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00037","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153385","source_hash":"540028fd98fa9460115e9aced09ca8e3c7679c3ef2fc3f48a69595d03e875005","text":"已取得必要资格或具备在主管监督下履行职责经验的人员"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00038","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153386","source_hash":"4a63986a12b1000851ad109f60bf832d830d1663a30d699a7f9389e41ee06184","text":"d. 行政管理措施，例如捐赠者同意书等、捐赠后护理以及为研究目的提供的咨询和联系"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00039","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153387","source_hash":"0bc6f5d4281538d4c5138e0832d6b39001337f0044a940ca352d9adb807b4258","text":"致力于 START  的人员"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00040","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153388","source_hash":"cb8c6b238f800814355e19339cd8accac66e3694f0770d65b3b95a72a190e49c","text":"备注"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00041","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153389","source_hash":"51a707f8a42f15e0354a7d09111e4133f4156e03ad512be017023d83a239a10f","text":"1。对于第 1(a) 款第 1) 至 5) 项所述的每项设施，如果申请许可的机构是医学院或"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00042","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153390","source_hash":"4a1b71d7483175a6f529df1de5fc8be58f712e090170c9e129e65a0ce9790cbc","text":"如果相关设施已作为联合医院的设施配备，则可以联合使用。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00043","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153391","source_hash":"49d1e65e5f72930e50a9d8e4b3668029430dbc03fba48356361bdc8c3a1beed1","text":"可以执行。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00044","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153392","source_hash":"cb78a8c6e95c971c6dd10685ece1dd7ec4f4776bde7e4b0c59bf9ddc9226ab02","text":"2. 根据《传染病预防和管理法实施法令》第1(a)款第1)至4)项规定，各设施"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00045","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153393","source_hash":"9aaa9c59fde190ae890b5d1ee5ec2a3ced9b843446bc5838cf88c2db458d4af8","text":"根据《条例》附件1-4，处理高风险病原体的设施的安全管理等级标准为2级或以上（2）。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00046","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153394","source_hash":"1fea3469f08a67c4275011d72f11a74cafc3a35e96db1a4499ca0454e0ad11c5","text":"作为 3 级或 4 级场所，必须采取相应的安全管理措施。"},{"id":"A29586-zh-00047","doc":"A29586","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153395","source_hash":"96383cd933f8d54d6e4d29d3f085d7ef9850b099a3033511cbe6ae9531063f15","text":"3. 根据第2条(a)款和(b)款规定，负责人和诊断负责人可以兼任多个职务。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00001","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153396","source_hash":"c41647cfde63f2bc5f43d2381ef396c3e6a1e3a5d830b282ee35261c9783ab2a","text":"■ 尸检及尸体保存法实施令[附录2] <2021年4月6日修订>"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00002","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153397","source_hash":"e6e39f7619a1d955cf656e0d6bcb46c9a599d5a40e14e78fcb37686d8ac74e9f","text":"行政罚款的适用标准（与第八条相关）"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00003","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153398","source_hash":"a617cf3ccc65ba6af0228b05b78c02b61364dbd74e669da8ea55dab0e5a320b6","text":"1. 通用标准"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00004","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153399","source_hash":"9aa9ae5e2ba7ac01cc37875ba5176d0b3062edefaaa41e62c9a0d4ad0af462e0","text":"a. 根据违规次数增加行政罚款的标准是，违规行为必须发生在过去两年内。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00005","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153400","source_hash":"9725fe60f1d96c5d4779838040c66e6fff9ab240039f74699109dac395fcb2f1","text":"这适用于处以罚款的情况。在这种情况下，期限的计算取决于违规行为的严重程度。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00006","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153401","source_hash":"3eb7733e572b774fa2cd9f5b2272dd33538807ac65ce6b851369286b64a6fe7c","text":"关于罚款日期与处罚后再次发现犯有相同违规行为的日期，"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00007","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153402","source_hash":"6757d843ad052d2c80118831d92fbee5d0c607a8e5806f44730fcb942b7e485c","text":"根据开始日期计算。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00008","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153403","source_hash":"3abcee61091df30544aea822393d7be00c2e230df0c42e48e3714bd305fff205","text":"b. 在依据第a项规定作出加重处罚的案件中，加重处罚的适用顺序为违法行为。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00009","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153404","source_hash":"1647f9678ce42610dae169191c9383a2f392bc84b4a06cd1d7fb64cf6f10a0b3","text":"先前的处置令（在同一项目下，同一期间内有两项或两项以上行政罚款处置的情况）"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00010","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153405","source_hash":"71756296611284f3c1f665df5f50ed9ad628948ede6569451d97728ae313dd9f","text":"以上指的是较高阶指令）应为下一阶指令。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00011","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153406","source_hash":"d2619a65380c55d638ad8950457249d91271e9418e74f1c75023092f067aab4b","text":"。在下列任何情况下，征税机关应当按照第2款的具体标准征税。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00012","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153407","source_hash":"58bb14e06e06e127070679ef7c9c195335062710380b709dfe627f23b7ad9253","text":"罚款金额可以减少，并可设定为原金额的一半以内。但是，如果行政罚款是……"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00013","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153408","source_hash":"cc9805135e441fb64c581ae7875d4172ce3c8ad215a96a38dade350cefe3836b","text":"但对于缴纳罚款的违规者来说，情况并非如此。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00014","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153409","source_hash":"474a13a9236c94201152c9a16b464c60368d3b640e1a7bd22636a8b368190f95","text":"1) 如果违规行为被认定为由于轻微疏忽或错误造成"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00015","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153410","source_hash":"1c2df5743e885978f9fd5bf127813f81d3d3c9fc851d2ba9f38a0d9654a97537","text":"2) 如果违规行为的性质或程度被认为是轻微的"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00016","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153411","source_hash":"e2bc9fe6b3e470161d9c8c70cb4ecaf9875c27e0c167c35db210f632a26725fa","text":"此外，考虑到违规程度、违规动机和后果等因素，有必要减少"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00017","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153412","source_hash":"0fa940f64e09a1b5149e2a1cb782fdb20f188f27d305070f5b6f02130a838237","text":"存在的情况下，"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00018","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153413","source_hash":"3b7381724af7c3465415c2f22098d131d86c21c57d1d16c23aea3e5e0fc70ff5","text":"d. 在下列任何一种情况下，征税机关应当按照第2款的具体标准征税。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00019","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153414","source_hash":"2b11b845073de4e2e99e3e0e297075c1162ef12c3d701e7378b1bca1fc32d48f","text":"罚款金额可能会增加，但增幅不得超过原金额的一半。但是，如果罚款金额增加……"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00020","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153415","source_hash":"c2141455885578d9c5639b1211338c11a3355e51006e34ece1b02ec86bf057bc","text":"即使在这种情况下，也不得超过该法第 21 条第 1 款规定的行政罚款的最高限额。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00021","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153416","source_hash":"8ec35bbbba6c0a2c1b35cf893654dc0d00e373711bc0491c64e263243f38f977","text":"1) 如果违规行为被认定为故意或因重大过失所致"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00022","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153417","source_hash":"e98508a0b8b7b0545bbf911fb800fdf9c6cc9a1d198b9a1183248ac7edac24ff","text":"此外，如果考虑到违规程度、违规动机及其后果等因素，有必要增加处罚力度。"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00023","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153418","source_hash":"0fa940f64e09a1b5149e2a1cb782fdb20f188f27d305070f5b6f02130a838237","text":"存在的情况下，"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00024","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153419","source_hash":"1d6f6bce78138ea58d3cc062dbce45c849d57266d25052a404c84318174a0c95","text":"2. 单个标准"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00025","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153420","source_hash":"903aa577eae3314c52694d8cb0c32f8a688802c384b7267385dc97b9afdad866","text":"违规"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00026","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153421","source_hash":"f301e09bb088a35ead5a94b8a5272800ed1989bf2a850f142c6a2bc9c86559d4","text":"法律依据"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00027","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153422","source_hash":"29868af714531b76fa12c0f1dcdcda16bef1ea9b78725e46eb97ac3b291f90a0","text":"罚款金额 (10,000 韩元)"},{"id":"A29587-zh-00028","doc":"A29587","law_id":"kr-004088-241263-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2153423","source_hash":"ac189b9e31e9838a878